        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Reporters Committee for Freedom of the Press\n- People: Walter Cronkite, Wolf Blitzer, Tony Mauro, Andrea Mitchell, Judy Woodruff\n- Roles: steering committee members, active member, anchorman\n- Products: CBS Evening News\n\nFacts:\n- Walter Leland Cronkite Jr. was born on November 4, 1916.\n- Walter Cronkite was an American broadcast journalist.\n- Walter Cronkite served as anchorman of the CBS Evening News from 1962 to 1981, a span of 19 years.\n- Walter Cronkite was an active member of the Reporters Committee for Freedom of the Press from 1973 until his death.\n- The steering committee of the Reporters Committee for Freedom of the Press includes Wolf Blitzer, Tony Mauro, Andrea Mitchell, and Judy Woodruff.\n- Walter Cronkite died on July 17, 2009.",
